---
title: "Figure 2 — System context: Reimagina, its users and the external systems it depends on"
config:
  flowchart:
    wrappingWidth: 520
  themeCSS: ".flowchartTitleText{font-size:30px;font-weight:600;fill:#16181d}"
---
flowchart LR
  planner["Urban planner / analyst<br/>[Person]<br/>Explores the territory,<br/>authors and compares<br/>what-if scenarios"]
  operator["Platform operator<br/>[Person]<br/>Loads data, launches<br/>and watches runs,<br/>inspects the catalogue"]

  reimagina["Reimagina<br/>[Software System]<br/>Ingests territorial data,<br/>computes urban indicators,<br/>evaluates scenario edits<br/>against a baseline and<br/>serves them to a web map"]

  overture["Overture Maps<br/>[External: public S3 bucket]<br/>Buildings, places and<br/>administrative divisions<br/>as GeoParquet"]
  osm["OpenStreetMap<br/>[External: Overpass API]<br/>Walking network,<br/>fetched with osmnx"]
  worldpop["WorldPop<br/>[External: REST API]<br/>Gridded population<br/>rasters (GeoTIFF)"]
  portals["INEGI and CDMX portals<br/>[External: HTTPS downloads]<br/>Marco geoestadístico (CDMX),<br/>colonias (SIGCDMX ArcGIS)"]
  lake["Private data lake<br/>[External: Azure storage]<br/>INEGI marco 2024, INEGI<br/>census 2020, amenity layers"]

  planner -->|"Explores,<br/>edits scenarios<br/>[HTTP]"| reimagina
  operator -->|"Ingests,<br/>runs, inspects<br/>[CLI, HTTP]"| reimagina
  reimagina -->|"Reads<br/>GeoParquet<br/>[S3, no auth]"| overture
  reimagina -->|"Fetches<br/>the network<br/>[Overpass]"| osm
  reimagina -->|"Downloads<br/>rasters<br/>[HTTPS]"| worldpop
  reimagina -->|"Downloads<br/>archives<br/>[HTTPS]"| portals
  lake -.->|"Copied by hand<br/>to local disk;<br/>never called"| reimagina

  classDef person fill:#0b4884,stroke:#073962,color:#fff
  classDef focus fill:#1168bd,stroke:#0b4884,color:#fff
  classDef external fill:#8a8a8a,stroke:#6b6b6b,color:#fff
  class planner,operator person
  class reimagina focus
  class overture,osm,worldpop,portals,lake external
